// 海外にも売るお店：商品ごとに売る通貨（円・ドル）、決済と在庫の確保を並行で待つ注文。通貨は slot で渡す。
// 「使うようになったら考える」だった4件（応答の中身・par の書き込み・合成型を使える場所・金額の単位）を使う題材。
// お店の例（../shop/shop.geas）の続きで、名前は半角英数、日本語の表示名は /// で付ける。

/// 在庫数
ltype StockCount = int 0..
/// 数量
ltype Quantity = int 1..99
/// 商品数量
ltype ProductQuantity = Product → Quantity
/// 税率値
ltype TaxRateValue = ratio 0..1
/// ID集合
ltype IdSet = set of id
/// ポイント
ltype PointCount = int 0..
/// 国コード
ltype CountryCode = text 2..2 of "A-Z"
/// 郵便番号
ltype PostalCode = text 3..10 of "0-9A-Z-"
/// 住所の行
ltype AddressLine = text 1..80
/// JANコード
ltype JanCode = text 13..13 of "0-9" check gtin
/// 配送先
ltype Address {
  /// 国
  country: CountryCode
  /// 郵便番号
  postal_code: PostalCode
  /// 住所
  line: AddressLine
}

/// 商品
entity Product {
  /// 商品ID
  product_id: id unique
  /// JANコード
  jan: JanCode required
  /// 在庫
  stock: StockCount required
  /// 通貨
  currency: currency required
  /// 価格
  price: money(currency) required
}

/// 顧客
entity Customer {
  /// 顧客ID
  customer_id: id unique
  /// ポイント
  points: PointCount required
}

/// 注文
entity Order {
  /// 注文ID
  order_id: id unique
  /// 顧客
  customer: ref Customer required
  /// 明細
  items: ProductQuantity required
  /// 配送先
  ship_to: Address required
  /// 通貨
  currency: currency required
  /// 合計
  total: money(currency) required
  /// 状態
  status: OrderStatus
}

/// 注文状態
state OrderStatus {
  /// 受付
  initial Received
  /// 決済要求済
  middle PaymentRequested
  final /// 完了
    Completed, /// キャンセル
    Canceled
  reject Completed → Canceled reason "完了後は返品で扱う"
}

/// 受注結果
result PlaceOrderResult {
  /// 受付
  Received(order_id: id)
  /// 在庫不足
  OutOfStock(/// 不足
    short: IdSet)
  /// 商品なし
  NoSuchProduct(/// 未登録
    unregistered: IdSet)
  /// 通貨が違う
  OtherCurrency(/// 違う商品
    mismatched: IdSet)
  /// 顧客なし
  NoSuchCustomer
}

/// 決済要求結果
result RequestPaymentResult {
  /// 要求済
  Requested
  /// 注文なし
  NoSuchOrder
  /// 状態違い
  WrongStatus
  /// 合計ゼロ
  ZeroTotal
}

/// 在庫確保の要求結果
result HoldResult {
  /// 要求済
  HoldRequested
  /// 注文なし
  NoSuchOrder
}

/// ポイント結果
result PointsResult {
  /// 加算済
  Granted
  /// 注文なし
  NoSuchOrder
  /// 顧客なし
  NoSuchCustomer
}

/// 決済と在庫の結果の見立て
result SettleResult {
  /// 承認
  Approved(order_id: id)
  /// 決済失敗
  PaymentFailed(order_id: id)
  /// 在庫を確保できず
  StockShort(order_id: id, /// 与信
    auth_id: id)
  /// 注文なし
  NoSuchOrder
  /// 状態違い
  WrongStatus
}

/// 取り消し結果
result CancelResult {
  /// 反映済
  Applied
  /// 注文なし
  NoSuchOrder
  /// 状態違い
  WrongStatus
}

/// 確定結果
result FinishResult {
  /// 反映済
  Applied
  /// 注文なし
  NoSuchOrder
  /// 状態違い
  WrongStatus
  /// 在庫が足りなかった
  StockLacking
}

/// 決済
effect Payment. /// 請求
  charge(order_id: id, /// 通貨
    currency: currency, /// 金額
    amount: money(currency))
effect Payment. /// 与信の取り消し
  refund(order_id: id, /// 与信
    auth_id: id) no_wait "返金の失敗は人が見る"
/// 倉庫
effect Warehouse. /// 在庫の確保
  hold(order_id: id, /// 届け先
    to: Address) joins OrderPending
/// 配送
effect Shipping. /// 出荷
  ship(order_id: id, /// 届け先
    to: Address) no_wait "出荷の結果は追跡の画面で人が見る"

/// 決済が済んだ（与信が取れたか、拒否か）
reply PaymentSettled(/// 与信
  auth_id: id)
/// 倉庫の返事（足りない商品があれば入る）
reply StockSettled(/// 不足
  short: IdSet)

/// 注文
deed place_order {
  input customer_id: id required, items: ProductQuantity required, ship_to: Address required
  /// 通貨
  slot currency: currency
  /// 税率
  slot tax_rate: TaxRateValue
  /// 送料
  slot shipping: money(currency)
  reads Product.stock, Product.price, Product.currency, Customer
  writes Order
  transition Order: (new) → Received
  result PlaceOrderResult
  effects none

  let customer = Customer[customer_id] else { return NoSuchCustomer }
  let unregistered = { k | (k, v) in items, Product[k] is absent }
  if unregistered is nonempty { return NoSuchProduct(unregistered) }
  let other_currency = { k | (k, v) in items, Product[k].currency != currency }
  if other_currency is nonempty { return OtherCurrency(other_currency) }
  let short = { k | (k, v) in items, Product[k].stock < v }
  if short is nonempty { return OutOfStock(short) }
  let subtotal = sum { Product[k].price * v | (k, v) in items }
  let total = subtotal + round(subtotal * tax_rate, floor, currency) + shipping
  let order = create Order { customer: customer_id, items: items, ship_to: ship_to, currency: currency, total: total, status: Received }
  return Received(order.order_id)
}

/// 決済要求
deed request_payment {
  input order_id: id required
  reads Order.total, Order.currency, Order.status
  writes Order.status
  transition Order: Received → PaymentRequested
  result RequestPaymentResult
  effects Payment.charge

  let order = Order[order_id] else { return NoSuchOrder }
  if order.status != Received { return WrongStatus }
  if order.total <= 0 { return ZeroTotal }
  order.status = PaymentRequested
  request Payment.charge(order_id, order.currency, order.total, idempotency_key = order_id)
  return Requested
}

/// 在庫の確保要求
deed request_stock_hold {
  input order_id: id required
  reads Order.ship_to
  result HoldResult
  effects Warehouse.hold

  let order = Order[order_id] else { return NoSuchOrder }
  request Warehouse.hold(order_id, order.ship_to, idempotency_key = order_id)
  return HoldRequested
}

/// キャンペーンポイントの加算
deed grant_campaign_points {
  input order_id: id required
  reads Order.customer, Customer.points
  writes Customer.points
  result PointsResult
  effects none

  let order = Order[order_id] else { return NoSuchOrder }
  let customer = Customer[order.customer] else { return NoSuchCustomer }
  customer.points += 5
  return Granted
}

/// ポイントの加算
deed grant_points {
  input order_id: id required
  reads Order.customer, Customer.points
  writes Customer.points
  result PointsResult
  effects none

  let order = Order[order_id] else { return NoSuchOrder }
  let customer = Customer[order.customer] else { return NoSuchCustomer }
  customer.points += 10
  return Granted
}

// 決済と倉庫の返事は、2つともそろってから見立てる。一部が失敗の中身で来ても、ここで判断する
/// 決済と在庫の見立て
deed settle_order {
  input order_id: id required, auth_id: id, short: IdSet
  reads Order.status
  result SettleResult
  effects none

  let order = Order[order_id] else { return NoSuchOrder }
  if order.status != PaymentRequested { return WrongStatus }
  let auth = auth_id else { return PaymentFailed(order_id) }
  let lacking = short else { return Approved(order_id) }
  return StockShort(order_id, auth)
}

/// 注文の確定
deed complete_order {
  input order_id: id required
  reads Order.status, Order.items, Order.ship_to, Product.stock
  writes Order.status, Product.stock
  transition Order: PaymentRequested → Completed
  result FinishResult
  effects Shipping.ship

  let order = Order[order_id] else { return NoSuchOrder }
  if order.status != PaymentRequested { return WrongStatus }
  let unregistered = { k | (k, v) in order.items, Product[k] is absent }
  if unregistered is nonempty { return StockLacking }
  let short = { k | (k, v) in order.items, Product[k].stock < v }
  if short is nonempty { return StockLacking }
  update { Product[k].stock -= v | (k, v) in order.items }
  order.status = Completed
  request Shipping.ship(order_id, order.ship_to, idempotency_key = order_id)
  return Applied
}

/// 決済失敗の取り消し
deed cancel_unpaid {
  input order_id: id required
  reads Order.status
  writes Order.status
  transition Order: PaymentRequested → Canceled
  result CancelResult
  effects none

  let order = Order[order_id] else { return NoSuchOrder }
  if order.status != PaymentRequested { return WrongStatus }
  order.status = Canceled
  return Applied
}

/// 在庫不足の返金と取り消し
deed refund_and_cancel {
  input order_id: id required, auth_id: id required
  reads Order.status
  writes Order.status
  transition Order: PaymentRequested → Canceled
  result CancelResult
  effects Payment.refund

  let order = Order[order_id] else { return NoSuchOrder }
  if order.status != PaymentRequested { return WrongStatus }
  order.status = Canceled
  request Payment.refund(order_id, auth_id, idempotency_key = order_id)
  return Applied
}

/// 決済状況の引き直し結果
result RecheckResult {
  /// 引き直し済
  Rechecked
  /// 注文なし
  NoSuchOrder
  /// 状態違い
  WrongStatus
}

// スマホや PC のアプリが、つながりを取り戻したときに呼ばれる。決済の返事を取りこぼしたかもしれない注文に、同じ冪等キーで請求を出し直して、決済の返事（PaymentSettled）をもう一度受ける。二重には請求されない
/// 決済状況の引き直し
deed recheck_payment {
  input order_id: id required
  reads Order.total, Order.currency, Order.status
  result RecheckResult
  effects Payment.charge

  let order = Order[order_id] else { return NoSuchOrder }
  if order.status != PaymentRequested { return WrongStatus }
  request Payment.charge(order_id, order.currency, order.total, idempotency_key = order_id)
  return Rechecked
}

/// 期限切れの取り消し
deed expire_order {
  input order_id: id required
  reads Order.status
  writes Order.status
  transition Order: PaymentRequested → Canceled
  result CancelResult
  effects none

  let order = Order[order_id] else { return NoSuchOrder }
  if order.status != PaymentRequested { return WrongStatus }
  order.status = Canceled
  return Applied
}

/// 注文一覧
query order_list {
  from Order
  where status != Canceled
  select order_id, customer.customer_id as customer, sum(items) as /// 点数
    item_count
  reads Order.status, Order.order_id, Order.customer, Customer.customer_id, Order.items
}

/// 決済の返事待ちの注文
query awaiting_payment {
  from Order
  where status == PaymentRequested
  reads Order.status
}

// ブラウザ拡張が使う。Amazon の ASIN から JAN への変換は拡張の側（クライアント）の仕事で、サーバーは JAN で引く
/// JANコードから価格を引く
query price_by_jan {
  input jan: JanCode required
  from Product
  filter jan equals jan
  select product_id, currency, price
  reads Product.jan, Product.product_id, Product.currency, Product.price
}

/// 注文受付
nexus Intake {
  place_order: Received → par { request_payment, request_stock_hold, grant_points, grant_campaign_points }, OutOfStock → reply, OtherCurrency → reply, NoSuchProduct → reply, NoSuchCustomer → reply
  request_payment: Requested → wait OrderPending, NoSuchOrder → reply, WrongStatus → reply, ZeroTotal → reply
  request_stock_hold: HoldRequested → reply, NoSuchOrder → reply
  grant_points: Granted → reply, NoSuchOrder → reply, NoSuchCustomer → reply
  grant_campaign_points: Granted → reply, NoSuchOrder → reply, NoSuchCustomer → reply
}

// 決済の返事と倉庫の返事がそろったら見立てる。そろわないまま30分たったら取り消す
/// 注文待ち
trigger OrderPending(order_id: id) {
  all reply PaymentSettled, StockSettled → settle_order
  deadline now + 30 min → expire_order
}

/// 確定の流れ
nexus Settlement {
  settle_order: Approved → complete_order, PaymentFailed → cancel_unpaid, StockShort → refund_and_cancel, NoSuchOrder → reply, WrongStatus → reply
  complete_order: Applied → reply, NoSuchOrder → reply, WrongStatus → reply, StockLacking → reply
  cancel_unpaid: Applied → reply, NoSuchOrder → reply, WrongStatus → reply
  refund_and_cancel: Applied → reply, NoSuchOrder → reply, WrongStatus → reply
  expire_order: Applied → reply, NoSuchOrder → reply, WrongStatus → reply
}

/// 決済状況の引き直しの流れ
nexus Recheck {
  recheck_payment: Rechecked → wait OrderPending, NoSuchOrder → reply, WrongStatus → reply
}

// アプリの「つながりが戻った」は、サーバーの外で起きる出来事。サーバーは、返事待ちの注文1件ずつに引き直しを起こす
/// つながりが戻った
event Reconnected {
  each awaiting_payment → recheck_payment
}

invariant Product: stock >= 0
invariant Order: status == PaymentRequested implies total > 0
